MoveTutor_Text_ThisMoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnce:
	.string "Are you ready to learn this move?$"
	.string "It will cost you 5.000¥.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ThisMoveCanOnlyBeLearnedOnceFinite:
	.string "This move can be learned only\n"
	.string "once. Is that okay?$"

MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerTeach:
	.string "Heh! My POKéMON totally rules!\n"
	.string "It's cooler than any POKéMON!\p"
	.string "I was lipping off with a swagger in\n"
	.string "my step like that when the CHAIRMAN\l"
	.string "chewed me out.\p"
	.string "That took the swagger out of my step.\p"
	.string "But hey-I'll pass it on to you!\p"
	.string "For just ¥2500, I can teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON the move SWAGGER.\p"
	.string "What do you say?$"

MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerDeclined:
	.string "What, no?\n"
	.string "C'mon, get into the spirit!$"

MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerWhichMon:
	.string "All right!\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON wants to learn how\l"
	.string "to SWAGGER?$"

MoveTutor_Text_SwaggerTaught:
	.string "Heh… maybe I don't need swagger\n"
	.string "to praise my POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But yours?\n"
	.string "It's got style now!$"

MoveTutor_Text_RolloutTeach:
	.string "Did you know that you can go from\n"
	.string "here a long way in that direction\l"
	.string "without changing direction?\p"
	.string "I might even be able to roll\n"
	.string "that way.\p"
	.string "Do you think your POKéMON will\n"
	.string "want to roll, too?\p"
	.string "I can teach one the move ROLLOUT\n"
	.string "for just ¥2500.\p"
	.string "What do you say?$"

MoveTutor_Text_RolloutDeclined:
	.string "Aw… you don't need to be shy about it.\n"
	.string "We'll roll together another time!$"

MoveTutor_Text_RolloutWhichMon:
	.string "Ehehe, sure thing!\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON should learn to roll?$"

MoveTutor_Text_RolloutTaught:
	.string "Rolling around in the grass makes me\n"
	.string "so happy!\p"
	.string "Come on… let's roll!$"

MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterTeach:
	.string "There's a move that gets stronger\n"
	.string "when you keep using it in a row.\p"
	.string "It's a BUG-type move, and it is\n"
	.string "wickedly cool.\p"
	.string "It's called FURY CUTTER.\p"
	.string "I'll teach it to your POKéMON for\n"
	.string "just ¥3500.\p"
	.string "Want me to teach it?$"

MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterDeclined:
	.string "Heh… guess we're not on the same\n"
	.string "wavelength.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterWhichMon:
	.string "Yay!\n"
	.string "Show me which POKéMON I should teach.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FuryCutterTaught:
	.string "I get a thrill watching it build up\n"
	.string "hit after hit!\p"
	.string "Keep it going, and it'll get\n"
	.string "stronger every time!$"

MoveTutor_TriAttackTeach:
	.string "Ah! A TRAINER! Excellent timing!\p"
	.string "I've been conducting research on\n"
	.string "multi-phase attack systems!\p"
	.string "Most moves rely on a single\n"
	.string "energy output...\p"
	.string "But TRI ATTACK?\p"
	.string "A perfect triad!\n"
	.string "Three distinct energies acting\n"
	.string "in harmony!\p"
	.string "Fire, ice, and electricity...\n"
	.string "a beautifully unstable system!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Fascinating, isn't it?\p"
	.string "For just 3333¥, I can teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON this phenomenon!\p"
	.string "Well? Care to participate in\n"
	.string "my experiment?$"

MoveTutor_TriAttackDeclined:
	.string "Ah… a shame.\p"
	.string "Not everyone appreciates\n"
	.string "elegant equations in motion…$"

MoveTutor_Text_TriAttackWhichMon:
	.string "Splendid!\p"
	.string "Now then, which POKéMON shall\n"
	.string "serve as our test subject-ah,\l"
	.string "I mean, student?$"

MoveTutor_Text_TriAttackTaught:
	.string "Remarkable!\p"
	.string "A perfect balance of opposing\n"
	.string "forces!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Remember, too much of one element,\n"
	.string "and the system collapses.\p"
	.string "But in harmony…\n"
	.string "it becomes something greater.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeTeach:
	.string "I want all sorts of things!\n"
	.string "But I used up my allowance…\p"
	.string "Wouldn't it be nice if there were\n"
	.string "a spell that made money appear when\l"
	.string "you waggle a finger?\p"
	.string "If you want, I can teach your POKéMON\n"
	.string "the move METRONOME.\p"
	.string "It'll cost just ¥2500…\n"
	.string "Not magic, but close enough!\p"
	.string "Money won't appear, but your POKéMON\n"
	.string "will waggle a finger. Yes?$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeDeclined:
	.string "Okay… I guess I'll just keep\n"
	.string "wishing for free money…$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeWhichMon:
	.string "Okay! I'll teach it!\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON should I teach?$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetronomeTaught:
	.string "When a POKéMON waggles its finger\n"
	.string "like a METRONOME, all sorts of nice\l"
	.string "things happen.\p"
	.string "Wouldn't it be nice if we could\n"
	.string "use it, too?$"

MoveTutor_Text_AcrobaticsTeach:
	.string "Humph! My wife… always leaping\n"
	.string "from branch to branch.\p"
	.string "Flipping, spinning… never still\n"
	.string "for a moment!\p"
	.string "Says it's about grace.\n"
	.string "About trusting the air itself.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Me? I used to think it was foolish.\p"
	.string "Too flashy. Too risky.\p"
	.string "But… there's something to it.\p"
	.string "When you carry nothing…\n"
	.string "when you commit completely…\p"
	.string "you move faster than anything\n"
	.string "bound to the ground.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "For 5000¥, I'll teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON ACROBATICS.\p"
	.string "If you're willing to let it move\n"
	.string "free.$"

MoveTutor_Text_AcrobaticsDeclined:
	.string "Hmph…\p"
	.string "Then keep your feet on the ground.\n"
	.string "Just don't expect to outpace\n"
	.string "those who don't.$"

MoveTutor_Text_AcrobaticsWhichMon:
	.string "Heh… so you've got some sense.\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn to\n"
	.string "trust the air?$"

MoveTutor_Text_AcrobaticsTaught:
	.string "…There.\p"
	.string "Light. Unburdened.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Maybe my wife was right all along.\p"
	.string "Move freely… strike swiftly.\n"
	.string "That's ACROBATICS.$"

MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteTeach:
	.string "…You're a TRAINER, right?\p"
	.string "Then you know hesitation costs\n"
	.string "you everything.\p"
	.string "On TRAINER HILL, there's no room\n"
	.string "for mistakes.\p"
	.string "You either outplay your opponent…\n"
	.string "or you lose.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "SUBSTITUTE is the ultimate tool.\p"
	.string "Create an opening.\n"
	.string "Force your opponent to react.\p"
	.string "Control the battle.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "For 12500¥, I'll teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON SUBSTITUTE.\p"
	.string "If you're serious about winning.$"

MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteDeclined:
	.string "…I see.\p"
	.string "Then you're not ready for\n"
	.string "TRAINER HILL.$"

MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteWhichMon:
	.string "Good.\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn to\n"
	.string "control the pace of battle?$"

MoveTutor_Text_SubstituteTaught:
	.string "…Not bad.\p"
	.string "Remember this.\p"
	.string "Battles aren't just strength.\n"
	.string "They're decisions.\p"
	.string "Make the right one…\n"
	.string "and your opponent never even\n"
	.string "touches you.\p"
	.string "I'll be waiting at the top.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusPunchTeach:
	.string "Hrrm…?\p"
	.string "Oh! A challenger?!\n"
	.string "Or are you here to admire my\n"
	.string "magnificent physique?!\p"
	.string "…Eh? Not impressed?\p"
	.string "Tch! Youth these days!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Listen well!\p"
	.string "In my prime, I trained on remote\n"
	.string "islands!\p"
	.string "Carried boulders! Fought waves!\n"
	.string "Ate nothing but discipline!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "FOCUS PUNCH…\p"
	.string "is the ultimate technique!\p"
	.string "You stand still… meditate…\n"
	.string "and strike at the perfect moment!\p"
	.string "Miss that moment…\n"
	.string "and you look like a complete fool!\p"
	.string "WAHAHA!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "For 5000¥, I'll teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON the secret!\p"
	.string "If you've got the nerve!$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusPunchDeclined:
	.string "Hmph!\p"
	.string "No guts, no glory!\p"
	.string "Come back when you're ready to\n"
	.string "come back and ask again!$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusPunchWhichMon:
	.string "Oho! Brave, are we?!\p"
	.string "Good! Good!\p"
	.string "Now then… which POKéMON will\n"
	.string "risk looking like a fool?!$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusPunchTaught:
	.string "WAHAHA! Excellent!\p"
	.string "You felt it, didn't you?!\p"
	.string "That moment… that PERFECT timing!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Remember this, youngster!\p"
	.string "Strength isn't in the punch…\n"
	.string "it's in the patience before it!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Now go! Train! Fail! Get hit!\n"
	.string "That's how you grow!$"

MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeTeach:
	.string "Sigh…\p"
	.string "VIRIDIAN's GYM LEADER is really\n"
	.string "lovably admirable.\p"
	.string "But that also means I have many\n"
	.string "rivals for his attention.\p"
	.string "He's got appeal with a DOUBLE-EDGE.\n"
	.string "I couldn't even catch his eye.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "If I'm to move forward, I need to\n"
	.string "be stronger, too.\p"
	.string "For 15000¥, let me teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON DOUBLE-EDGE.\p"
	.string "A move that gives everything,\n"
	.string "no matter the cost.$"

MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeDeclined:
	.string "Oh…\p"
	.string "Even you turned away from me…$"

MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeWhichMon:
	.string "All right…\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON will give it\n"
	.string "their all?$"

MoveTutor_Text_DoubleEdgeTaught:
	.string "…I understand now.\p"
	.string "To give everything, even if it hurts.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I won't live for love alone anymore.\n"
	.string "I'll become strong.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionTeach::
	.string "…You hear it, don't you?\p"
	.string "Even now… beneath the silence.\p"
	.string "Like a chord still ringing\n"
	.string "after the song is over.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I used to play here on CINNABAR.\n"
	.string "Loud. Proud.\p"
	.string "Then the volcano answered back.\p"
	.string "One note… louder than anything\n"
	.string "I ever played.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "EXPLOSION is like that.\p"
	.string "Not a melody…\n"
	.string "just a final, overwhelming sound.\p"
	.string "For 15000¥, I'll teach it to your\n"
	.string "POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But understand what you're asking\n"
	.string "for.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionDeclined::
	.string "…Yeah.\p"
	.string "Not every song needs to end\n"
	.string "that way.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionWhichMon::
	.string "Alright.\p"
	.string "Which one's ready to play\n"
	.string "the final note?$"

MoveTutor_Text_ExplosionTaught::
	.string "…There.\p"
	.string "That's the sound.\p"
	.string "Raw. Final.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Don't overplay it.\n"
	.string "Even the strongest chord loses\n"
	.string "meaning if you keep hitting it.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Make it count.$"

MoveTutor_Text_SoftboiledTeach:
	.string "Hello, there!\p"
	.string "I've seen you about, but I never\n"
	.string "had a chance to chat.\p"
	.string "It must be good luck that brought\n"
	.string "us together finally.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "To celebrate, I could teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON SOFTBOILED.\p"
	.string "For just ¥1000, of course.\n"
	.string "What do you say?$"

MoveTutor_Text_SoftboiledDeclined:
	.string "Oh, I see…\p"
	.string "I'll always be keeping an eye out\n"
	.string "for you.\p"
	.string "I hope we can chat again.$"

MoveTutor_Text_SoftboiledWhichMon:
	.string "How lovely!\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON shall receive\n"
	.string "a little care?$"

MoveTutor_Text_SoftboiledTaught:
	.string "There we are… all better.\p"
	.string "SOFTBOILED is a gentle move,\n"
	.string "but a very dependable one.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I wish you and your POKéMON\n"
	.string "the very best.$"

MoveTutor_Text_HeatWaveTeach:
	.string "Ah, a visitor to the museum…\p"
	.string "I have been studying ancient\n"
	.string "climate records for years now.\p"
	.string "There are patterns… disturbing ones.\p"
	.string "Heat waves of immense intensity\n"
	.string "once swept across this region.\p"
	.string "Some believe they contributed to\n"
	.string "the extinction of certain POKéMON.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "For 10000¥, I can teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON HEAT WAVE.\p"
	.string "A force of overwhelming thermal\n"
	.string "energy.$"

MoveTutor_Text_HeatWaveDeclined:
	.string "I see…\p"
	.string "Some truths are easier to ignore\n"
	.string "than to study.$"

MoveTutor_Text_HeatWaveWhichMon:
	.string "Very well.\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON shall I subject\n"
	.string "to this phenomenon?$"

MoveTutor_Text_HeatWaveTaught:
	.string "A fascinating result…\p"
	.string "HEAT WAVE is not merely an attack.\n"
	.string "It is a remnant of ancient climate.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I hope you will consider what it\n"
	.string "represents.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ThunderWaveTeach:
	.string "…Come closer, young one.\p"
	.string "In battle, haste is the first\n"
	.string "path to defeat.\p"
	.string "To slow one's opponent is to\n"
	.string "command the flow of time itself.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I am a sought after strategist.\n"
	.string "I teach control above strength.\p"
	.string "For 7500¥, I will guide your\n"
	.string "POKéMON in THUNDER WAVE.\p"
	.string "A technique of restraint and\n"
	.string "control.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I accept these donations only to\n"
	.string "maintain my life of training.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ThunderWaveDeclined:
	.string "I see…\p"
	.string "Then your path is still one of\n"
	.string "urgency and noise.$"

MoveTutor_Text_ThunderWaveWhichMon:
	.string "Good.\p"
	.string "Now choose carefully.\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn patience?$"

MoveTutor_Text_ThunderWaveTaught:
	.string "Understand this well.\p"
	.string "To paralyze is not to harm…\n"
	.string "it is to control the rhythm of battle.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Walk slowly, and victory will\n"
	.string "arrive before you do.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FissureTeach:
	.string "…So you've come here.\p"
	.string "I once stood among the strongest\n"
	.string "TRAINERS in the world.\p"
	.string "Battles were not contests to me…\n"
	.string "they were conclusions.\p"
	.string "There is a moment in combat where\n"
	.string "everything becomes decided.\p"
	.string "One strike. One opening.\n"
	.string "No hesitation.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "For 25000¥, I will teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON FISSURE.\p"
	.string "A move that ends battles in a\n"
	.string "single, decisive instant.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FissureDeclined:
	.string "Hmph…\p"
	.string "Then you are not yet ready to\n"
	.string "understand decisive victory.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FissureWhichMon:
	.string "Good.\p"
	.string "Now choose.\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn it?$"

MoveTutor_Text_FissureTaught:
	.string "Remember this well.\p"
	.string "Power without certainty is wasted.\n"
	.string "FISSURE is certainty made form.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "Do not rely on it blindly.\n"
	.string "Only when the moment is absolute.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetalClawTeach:
	.string "Hah!\p"
	.string "You've got spirit, kid, but spirit\n"
	.string "alone won't win battles.\p"
	.string "Power needs precision.\n"
	.string "Strength needs discipline.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "I train with my KINGLER.\p"
	.string "Those claws can crush boulders…\n"
	.string "but only because they're controlled.\p"
	.string "For 2500¥, I'll teach your\n"
	.string "POKéMON METAL CLAW.\p"
	.string "Strike clean. Strike sharp.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetalClawDeclined:
	.string "Heh!\p"
	.string "Then keep flailing until you\n"
	.string "understand what control means.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetalClawWhichMon:
	.string "Good!\p"
	.string "Now pick one.\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON will I train?$"

MoveTutor_Text_MetalClawTaught:
	.string "That's it!\p"
	.string "Feel the weight behind every\n"
	.string "clean strike.\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "METAL CLAW is brute discipline\n"
	.string "made manifest.\p"
	.string "Just like my KINGLER's grip.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaPunchTeach:
    .string "A punch of roaring ferocity!\p"
    .string "Packed with destructive power!\p"
    .string "When the chips are down,\n"
    .string "MEGA PUNCH is the ultimate attack!\l"
    .string "You agree, yes?\p"
    .string "Now!\n"
    .string "For just ¥5000, I will teach it\n"
	.string "to your POKéMON!$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaPunchDeclined:
    .string "You'll be back when you understand\n"
    .string "the worth of MEGA PUNCH.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaPunchWhichMon:
    .string "Fine!\n"
    .string "Which POKéMON will learn it?$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaPunchTaught:
    .string "Now, we are comrades in the way of\n"
    .string "punching!\p"
    .string "You should go before you're seen\n"
    .string "by the misguided fool who trains\l"
    .string "only his silly kicking over there.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaKickTeach:
    .string "A kick of brutal ferocity!\p"
    .string "Packed with destructive power!\p"
    .string "When you get right down to it,\n"
    .string "MEGA KICK is the ultimate attack!\l"
    .string "Don't you agree?\p"
    .string "Okay!\n"
    .string "For just ¥5000, I'll teach it to\n"
	.string "your POKéMON!$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaKickDeclined:
    .string "You'll come crawling back when you\n"
    .string "realize the value of MEGA KICK.$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaKickWhichMon:
    .string "All right!\n"
    .string "Which POKéMON wants to learn it?$"

MoveTutor_Text_MegaKickTaught:
    .string "Now, we are soul mates in the way\n"
    .string "of kicking!\p"
    .string "You should run before you're seen\n"
    .string "by the deluded nitwit who trains\l"
    .string "only simple punching over there.$"

MoveTutor_Text_RockSlideTeach:
    .string "Whoa… careful where you step.\n"
    .string "These tunnels aren't exactly stable.\p"
    .string "You ever think about it?\n"
    .string "All this rock above your head…\p"
    .string "One rumble and then…\n"
    .string "WAAAAAAAAAH!\p"
    .string "Boulders crashing down from the\n"
    .string "dark!\p"
    .string "…Heh. You don't seem scared at all.\p"
    .string "Tell you what…\n"
    .string "for ¥7500, I can teach your POKéMON\l"
    .string "ROCK SLIDE.\p"
    .string "Want to try it?$"

MoveTutor_Text_RockSlideDeclined:
    .string "Oh… so you are scared after all.$"

MoveTutor_Text_RockSlideWhichMon:
    .string "Heh! Which POKéMON should I teach\n"
    .string "ROCK SLIDE?$"

MoveTutor_Text_RockSlideTaught:
    .string "Just imagine those rocks crashing\n"
    .string "down on your opponent!\p"
    .string "…Might be a little scary to use it\n"
    .string "in this tunnel, though…$"

MoveTutor_Text_IcyWindTeach:
	.string "Ah… the lake still rages, even now.\p"
	.string "But do you feel it?\n"
	.string "A wind drifts here from the east.\p"
	.string "Cold… steady…\n"
	.string "It calms even the restless water.\p"
	.string "I have studied that wind for many years.\p"
	.string "It slows battles… softens movement…\n"
	.string "yet never truly harms.\p"
	.string "For ¥5000, I can teach your POKéMON\n"
	.string "the move ICY WIND.\p"
	.string "Will you listen to the wind?$"

MoveTutor_Text_IcyWindDeclined:
	.string "Hm…\n"
	.string "Then you do not yet hear the wind.$"

MoveTutor_Text_IcyWindWhichMon:
	.string "Good…\n"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn to feel\n"
	.string "the eastern wind?$"

MoveTutor_Text_IcyWindTaught:
	.string "The wind will follow it now.\p"
	.string "Slow the world… and you will see\n"
	.string "its shape more clearly.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusBlastTeach:
	.string "…Listen closely.\p"
	.string "Out here, where the sea meets\n"
	.string "the cliffs, there is no room for\l"
	.string "distractions.\p"
	.string "Power must be gathered…\n"
	.string "then released all at once.\p"
	.string "That is the essence of\n"
	.string "FOCUS BLAST.\p"
	.string "It is not an easy technique.\n"
	.string "But in the right moment…\l"
	.string "it decides everything.\p"
	.string "I can teach it to your POKéMON\n"
	.string "for ¥20000.\p"
	.string "Will you learn to strike with\n"
	.string "true focus?$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusBlastDeclined:
	.string "…I see.\p"
	.string "Then return when your focus\n"
	.string "is stronger.$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusBlastWhichMon:
	.string "Good.\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn to\n"
	.string "gather its strength?$"

MoveTutor_Text_FocusBlastTaught:
	.string "Do not waste that power.\p"
	.string "FOCUS BLAST demands patience…\n"
	.string "and perfect timing.$"

MoveTutor_Text_BideTeach:
	.string "The waters around SPROUT TOWER…\n"
	.string "they are never truly still.\p"
	.string "Even when calm, they gather\n"
	.string "strength beneath the surface.\p"
	.string "A POKéMON must learn the same.\p"
	.string "To endure… to wait… and then\n"
	.string "return all it has received.\p"
	.string "This is the way of BIDE.\p"
	.string "For a humble donation of ¥2500,\n"
	.string "shall I teach it to your POKéMON?$"

MoveTutor_Text_BideDeclined:
	.string "Patience cannot be rushed.\p"
	.string "Return when you are ready\n"
	.string "to wait.$"

MoveTutor_Text_BideWhichMon:
	.string "Very well…\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON will learn\n"
	.string "to endure in silence?$"

MoveTutor_Text_BideTaught:
	.string "Remember…\p"
	.string "Power is not always shown\n"
	.string "in the moment.\p"
	.string "Those who wait… strike\n"
	.string "with greater force.$"

MoveTutor_Text_AncientPowerTeach:
	.string "Ah… a discerning visitor.\p"
	.string "These fossils you see in our MUSEUM\n"
	.string "are relics of a far older world.\p"
	.string "Though ages have passed,\n"
	.string "their power has not faded.\p"
	.string "The PEWTER GYM LEADER, BROCK,\n"
	.string "is a dear friend of mine,\l"
	.string "a gentleman of admirable taste\l"
	.string "in such ancient matters.\p"
	.string "You have proven yourself against\n"
	.string "him…\p"
	.string "Perhaps you are ready to inherit\n"
	.string "the power I seek to remember.\p"
	.string "Shall I teach your POKéMON\n"
	.string "ANCIENT POWER?$"

MoveTutor_Text_AncientPowerDeclined:
	.string "I see…\p"
	.string "Not all are inclined to heed\n"
	.string "the call of antiquity.$"

MoveTutor_Text_AncientPowerWhichMon:
	.string "Very good.\p"
	.string "Which POKéMON shall be entrusted\n"
	.string "with this ancient force?$"

MoveTutor_Text_AncientPowerTaught:
	.string "Power from another age…\p"
	.string "May it guide you forward.$"

MoveTutor_Text_AncientPowerNotReady:
	.string "Ah… a curious visitor.\p"
	.string "Our MUSEUM's exhibits hold great power,\n"
	.string "but not all are ready to wield it.\p"
	.string "Prove your strength against BROCK,\n"
	.string "then return.$"

